    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Amritsari fish serves 4 and takes about 35 minutes plus marinating. Coat the fish in the spiced batter and chill it so it clings. Get the oil hot so the batter crisps fast."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fry in small batches so the oil stays hot and the fish stays crisp."
          }
        ]
      },
